Today is Friday.
This evening I have to go to the beauty parlor.
I arrive there at exactly six forty-five.
The woman at the beauty parlor smiles at me.
She tells me to sit on a chair.
First, she washes my hair well.
I always like that very much.
Then she starts to cut my hair.
She cuts the hair very short.
Sometimes I close my eyes.
After a little while, my haircut is finished.
I look in the big mirror in front.
My hair is very short now.
This short hair is very easy to comb every day.
I like my new style a lot.
I look in the mirror and smile broadly.
This is my first haircut in Kochi.
